{"id":"n20830-1-7","stage":4,"title":"연하 · 年龄小","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20830-1-7-1","ko":"너 연하랑 사귄다며? 진짜야?","zh":"你说你在和比你年轻的人交往？是真的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"연하랑","meaning":"年龄小，年纪轻","explanation":"연하：年龄小，年纪轻；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"연하","audio":"/audio/4bcc31d55144487fef1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20830","senseId":"1","lemma":"연하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연하랑","audio":"/audio/3cca55fd74f3d6237c77.mp3"}},{"text":"사귄다며?","meaning":"交，结交，交往","explanation":"사귀다：交，结交，交往；ㄴ다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"사귀다","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15656","senseId":"1","lemma":"사귀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사귄다며","audio":"/audio/84018b6ea265086a7889.mp3"}},{"text":"진짜야?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"진짜：真的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71539","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진짜야","audio":"/audio/45bd52fb3d0bd4de624a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4bcc31d55144487f","term":"연하","zh":"年龄小，年纪轻","audio":"/audio/4bcc31d55144487fef1e.mp3","entryId":"20830","definition":"比自己年龄小；或指那样的人。","pronunciation":["연하"]},{"id":"cdf64a5f4a894678","term":"사귀다","zh":"交，结交，交往","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3","entryId":"15656","definition":"相互了解并亲近地相处。","pronunciation":["사귀다"]},{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71539","definition":"没有假装或虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["진짜"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c9002c2d228adfa355b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20830-1-7-2","ko":"응. 나보다 두 살 어린 사람이야.","zh":"嗯。是比我小两岁的人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"나보다","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나보다","audio":"/audio/6ab7ce48bac772c090d1.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"살","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}},{"text":"어린","meaning":"年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年龄小；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"2","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린","audio":"/audio/f78bf8d27dff1667b0ba.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이야.","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564